{"sha": "09779a9045b1998f423425f3ecb5a1216719a565ea79554f9f1e30b13df45b08", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:heat-engines} 章 --- 热机与机器}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:heat-engines:1}", "$\\eta_C = 1 - 300/800 = 0.625$。取 $0.40$ 时：$\\dot Q_h = 1.0/0.40 = \\qty{2.5}{GW}$", "从燃料中吸热，$\\dot Q_c = 2.5 - 1.0 = \\qty{1.5}{GW}$ 排入河中——", "排掉的热量比售出的电能还多。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:heat-engines:2}", "$e_f \\leq 275/(298 - 275) = 12$。取 $e_f = 3$ 时：$P = 100/3 = \\qty{33}{W}$", "（另有 \\qty{133}{W} 进入厨房）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:heat-engines:3}", "$r = 9$：$9^{0.4} = 2.41$，$\\eta = 0.585$；$r = 11$：$11^{0.4} = 2.61$，", "$\\eta = 0.62$。当 $r = 20$ 时，汽油－空气混合物被压缩到约", "\\qty{900}{K}，会在火花塞点火之前自燃（爆震），损坏", "发动机；只有仅压缩空气的柴油机才能达到这一压缩比。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:heat-engines:4}", "$e_p \\leq 300/20 = 15$：理想功率 $5/15 = \\qty{0.33}{kW}$；实际功率 $5/3.5 =", "\\qty{1.43}{kW}$；电阻器则为 \\qty{5}{kW}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:heat-engines:5}", "绝热线：$V_C = V_B(T_h/T_c)^{1/(\\gamma-1)} = 3.0 \\times (5/3)^{2.5} =", "\\qty{10.8}{L}$，$V_D = 1.0 \\times 3.59 = \\qty{3.59}{L}$（故 $V_C/V_D = 3 =", "V_B/V_A$）。$Q_h = RT_h\\ln3 = 8.314 \\times 500 \\times 1.099 = \\qty{4.57}{kJ}$，", "$Q_c = -RT_c\\ln3 = \\qty{-2.74}{kJ}$，$W = -(4.57 - 2.74) = \\qty{-1.83}{kJ}$，", "$\\eta = 1.83/4.57 = 0.40 = 1 - 300/500$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:heat-engines:6}", "先看第一种说法：能量 $200 = 1000 - 800$ 平衡；克劳修斯不等式 $1000/400 - 800/300", "= 2.5 - 2.67 = \\qty{-0.17}{J/K}$，故 $S_{\\mathrm{created}} = \\qty{0.17}{J/K} \\geq 0$，", "可能成立（$\\eta = 0.20$）。再看第二种：$1000/400 - 700/300 = +\\qty{0.17}{J/K} > 0$，", "意味着熵被消灭了——不可能。最大效率：$\\eta_C = 1 -", "300/400 = 0.25$，即 \\qty{250}{J}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:heat-engines:7}", "$r^{\\gamma-1} = 18^{0.4} = 3.18$；$\\rho^\\gamma = 2^{1.4} = 2.64$：$\\eta = 1 -", "1.64/(1.4 \\times 3.18 \\times 1) = 0.63$。奥托循环在 $r = 18$ 时：$1 - 1/3.18 = 0.69$；", "在 $r = 9$ 时：$0.585$。柴油机压缩的是纯空气：压缩过程中不存在燃料，无法提前点火，", "燃料喷入 \\qty{900}{K} 的空气后即刻燃烧，", "因此不存在爆震极限。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:heat-engines:8}", "$Q_h = RT_h\\ln2 = 8.314 \\times 600 \\times 0.693 = \\qty{3.46}{kJ}$，$Q_c = -8.314", "\\times 300 \\times 0.693 = \\qty{-1.73}{kJ}$：每个循环 $W = \\qty{-1.73}{kJ}$。有", "回热器时 $\\eta = 1.73/3.46 = 0.50 = 1 - 300/600$。无回热器时，热源还须", "提供 $C_{V,m}(T_h - T_c) = 2.5 \\times 8.314 \\times 300 =", "\\qty{6.24}{kJ}$：$\\eta = 1.73/(3.46 + 6.24) = 0.18$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:heat-engines:9}", "两个物块的熵变：$\\Delta S = C\\ln(T_f/T_1) + C\\ln(T_f/T_2) =", "C\\ln\\bigl(T_f^2/T_1T_2\\bigr) = S_{\\mathrm{created}} \\geq 0$（热机自身的", "熵在每个循环后都回到原值），故 $T_f \\geq \\sqrt{T_1T_2}$，且", "$W = C(T_1 + T_2 - 2T_f)$（第一定律）在 $T_f$ 最小时最大：", "可逆情形下 $T_f = \\sqrt{400 \\times 300} = \\qty{346.4}{K}$，", "$W_{\\max} = 4000 \\times (700 - 692.8) = \\qty{29}{kJ}$。直接接触时：$T_f =", "\\qty{350}{K}$，不做功，$S_{\\mathrm{created}} = 4000\\ln(350^2/120000) =", "\\qty{82}{J/K}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:heat-engines:10}", "(a) $P = \\dot Q_h - |\\dot Q_c| = K(T_h - x) - K(y - T_c)$；可逆的核心", "不产生净熵交换：$K(T_h - x)/x = K(y - T_c)/y$。(b) 交叉相乘：", "$y(T_h - x) = x(y - T_c)$，故 $y(T_h - 2x) = -xT_c$，$y = xT_c/(2x - T_h)$。", "于是 $P = K(T_h - x)(1 - y/x) = K(T_h - x)(2x - T_h - T_c)/(2x - T_h)$；令", "$u = 2x - T_h$，则 $T_h - x = (T_h - u)/2$，且 $P = K(T_h - u)(u - T_c)/(2u) =", "\\tfrac{K}{2}[(T_h + T_c) - u - T_hT_c/u]$。(c) $\\dd P/\\dd u = \\tfrac K2(-1 +", "T_hT_c/u^2) = 0$，解得 $u = \\sqrt{T_hT_c}$，为极大值；此时 $x = (T_h +", "\\sqrt{T_hT_c})/2$，$y = xT_c/u = (\\sqrt{T_hT_c} + T_c)/2$，且 $\\eta^\\ast = 1 - y/x", "= 1 - \\sqrt{T_c}(\\sqrt{T_h} + \\sqrt{T_c})/[\\sqrt{T_h}(\\sqrt{T_h} + \\sqrt{T_c})] = 1 -", "\\sqrt{T_c/T_h}$；$P_{\\max} = \\tfrac K2(\\sqrt{T_h} - \\sqrt{T_c})^2$。(d)", "$\\eta^\\ast = 1 - \\sqrt{0.375} = 0.39$，而 $\\eta_C = 0.625$：实际值 $0.40$", "（\\cref{exo:b1:heat-engines:1}）所示的热机是为功率而设计的，", "而非为效率。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:heat-engines:11}", "循环过程：$Q_h + Q_c + Q_0 = 0$，且 $Q_h/T_h + Q_c/T_c + Q_0/T_0 \\leq 0$。", "消去 $Q_0 = -(Q_h + Q_c)$：$Q_h(1/T_h - 1/T_0) + Q_c(1/T_c - 1/T_0) \\leq 0$，", "即 $Q_c(T_0 - T_c)/(T_cT_0) \\leq Q_h(T_h - T_0)/(T_hT_0)$，从而", "$Q_c/Q_h \\leq (1 - T_0/T_h)\\,T_c/(T_0 - T_c)$。第一个因子是", "燃烧器与室温之间卡诺热机的效率，第二个因子是", "舱室与室温之间卡诺制冷机的性能系数：该上界", "即两者理想耦合所能得到的结果。数值：$0.25 \\times 11 = 2.75$", "（实际吸收式制冷机约为 $0.6$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:heat-engines:12}", "(a) \\qty{0.40}{J}。(b) $0.40 \\times 3.5 = \\qty{1.4}{J}$。(c) \\qty{0.90}{J}。", "(d) 热机 $\\eta = 1 - 293/800 = 0.634$，热泵 $e_p = 293/20 = 14.65$：", "$0.634 \\times 14.65 = \\qty{9.3}{J}$（热机自身的 \\qty{0.37}{J}", "在 \\qty{293}{K} 排出，也可用来供暖：共计 \\qty{9.7}{J}）。多于一焦耳，", "是因为其余部分取自室外空气：能量守恒，", "而热力学第二定律只要求熵不被消灭，", "可逆的串联系统恰好满足这一要求。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:heat-engines:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $P = 250 \\times 25 = \\qty{6.25}{kW}$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 平均损耗 $250 \\times 13 = \\qty{3.25}{kW}$，对应 $200 \\times 86400 =", "\\qty{1.73e7}{s}$：$E = \\qty{5.6e10}{J} = \\qty{15600}{kW h}$。", ""]}